{
    "title": "Echocalypse: Scarlet Covenant",
    "description": "\u2665All That Belonged To Me, Now Belong To You\u2665\r\nA New Version Has Launched! The Oath System is Now Live\r\n\r\nWe're kicking off with a special SSR Levia Oath Outfit!\r\n\r\nEchocalypse: The Scarlet Covenant is a stunning zero-loss RPG mobile game. As per your request. we are now launching the Oath System! Meet the new Case Lilith and explore the Realm Expedition for exclusive patch benefits. Collect Oath tokens, win the girls' hearts, and make your unique Oath! It's time to awaken the true power of the Cases!\r\n\r\nOath System Now Live\r\n\r\nThe Oath System, the star of this update, is finally here! Collect Oath tokens to bond with your favorite Cases and unlock their unique stories. Some even come with special interactions! And don't miss the limited-time [Lingering Fragrance] event featuring the fan-favorite Lilith! Get ready for an unforgettable time with this mysterious girl from Siloam. A hug? A lift? Holding hands? Kisses? French kisses?? It's all up to you!\r\n\r\nGet Levia's Exclusive Oath Outfit for FREE!\r\n\r\nIn the new sign-in event, all Awakeners will get Levia's exclusive Oath token Sacred Oath] for free! Plus, to celebrate the launch of the Oath System, the new expedition gameplay [Floral Oath] is now live! Team up with other Awakeners to explore the map, trigger special events, defeat bosses, and gather Oath materials in exchange for Oath tokens. Let's do this! You're full of energy, and she's got a secret crush!\r\n\r\nEnhanced Benefits and Rewards\r\n\r\nMore benefits without extra cost! Enjoy daily free 10-draws and a ton of training resources. clearing the Expedition has never been easier. The new system supports quick replacement of allies. Plus, there's a new starter pool with 6 limited SSR Cases to give you a head start! You're sure to win this time!\r\n\r\nGet more perks without paying extra! Enjoy daily free 10-draws and loads of training resources. Clearing the Expedition has never been easier with the new quick ally swap feature! Plus, there's a new starter pool featuring 6 limited SSR Cases to give you a head start. You're set to win this time!\r\n\r\nStylish Outfits for Your Oaths\r\n\r\nOath-making just got a stylish upgrade! The new Oath System brings exclusive limited outfits for Cases. Designed by top artists from China, Japan, and Korea, each outfit features stunning live 2D designs and gorgeous illustrations. Every Case will get unique outfits that give them a fresh look every time you see them!\r\n\r\nOfficial Channels\r\nFacebook:https://www.facebook.com/Echocalypse\r\nDiscord:https://discord.gg/V6sbeEctTR\r\nTwitter:https://twitter.com/Echocalypse_EN\r\nInstagram:https://www.instagram.com/echocalypse/\r\nYouTube:https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc6LL2TSgBdwq1ZzJx8t_Gg\r\nWebsite:https://echocalypseglobal.gtarcade.com/en/main",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2665All That Belonged To Me, Now Belong To You\u2665<br>A New Version Has Launched! The Oath System is Now Live<br><br>We&#39;re kicking off with a special SSR Levia Oath Outfit!<br><br>Echocalypse: The Scarlet Covenant is a stunning zero-loss RPG mobile game. As per your request. we are now launching the Oath System! Meet the new Case Lilith and explore the Realm Expedition for exclusive patch benefits. Collect Oath tokens, win the girls&#39; hearts, and make your unique Oath! It&#39;s time to awaken the true power of the Cases!<br><br>Oath System Now Live<br><br>The Oath System, the star of this update, is finally here! Collect Oath tokens to bond with your favorite Cases and unlock their unique stories. Some even come with special interactions! And don&#39;t miss the limited-time [Lingering Fragrance] event featuring the fan-favorite Lilith! Get ready for an unforgettable time with this mysterious girl from Siloam. A hug? A lift? Holding hands? Kisses? French kisses?? It&#39;s all up to you!<br><br>Get Levia&#39;s Exclusive Oath Outfit for FREE!<br><br>In the new sign-in event, all Awakeners will get Levia&#39;s exclusive Oath token Sacred Oath] for free! Plus, to celebrate the launch of the Oath System, the new expedition gameplay [Floral Oath] is now live! Team up with other Awakeners to explore the map, trigger special events, defeat bosses, and gather Oath materials in exchange for Oath tokens. Let&#39;s do this! You&#39;re full of energy, and she&#39;s got a secret crush!<br><br>Enhanced Benefits and Rewards<br><br>More benefits without extra cost! Enjoy daily free 10-draws and a ton of training resources. clearing the Expedition has never been easier. The new system supports quick replacement of allies. Plus, there&#39;s a new starter pool with 6 limited SSR Cases to give you a head start! You&#39;re sure to win this time!<br><br>Get more perks without paying extra! Enjoy daily free 10-draws and loads of training resources. Clearing the Expedition has never been easier with the new quick ally swap feature! Plus, there&#39;s a new starter pool featuring 6 limited SSR Cases to give you a head start. You&#39;re set to win this time!<br><br>Stylish Outfits for Your Oaths<br><br>Oath-making just got a stylish upgrade! The new Oath System brings exclusive limited outfits for Cases. Designed by top artists from China, Japan, and Korea, each outfit features stunning live 2D designs and gorgeous illustrations. Every Case will get unique outfits that give them a fresh look every time you see them!<br><br>Official Channels<br>Facebook:https://www.facebook.com/Echocalypse<br>Discord:https://discord.gg/V6sbeEctTR<br>Twitter:https://twitter.com/Echocalypse_EN<br>Instagram:https://www.instagram.com/echocalypse/<br>YouTube:https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc6LL2TSgBdwq1ZzJx8t_Gg<br>Website:https://echocalypseglobal.gtarcade.com/en/main",
